# ==============================================================
# TalentPulse AI Frontend - Environment Variable Configuration
# ==============================================================

# Backend API Base URL
# - In local dev using Vite proxy, leave empty or set to '/api'
# - In standalone or production deployments, set to the backend URL:
#   Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api
#   Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.talentpulse.yourdomain.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
